Dear Mr Worthington

Thank you for your submission in response to my request for your views on
the proposed regulation of computer games and images.

The purpose of this letter is to advise you of the main features likely in
the proposed regulatory scheme for computer games and to ask for your
views.

The main features of the proposal at this stage are:

(i) Computer games or images offered for sale, hire or arcade use would be
subject to classification against an agreed set of guidelines. The 
exceptions would be:

(a) 'Bulletin Board Systems' would remain the responsibility of
Telecom/Austel under Telecommunications legislation; and

